"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf B^-\">\\(\\mathbf B^-\\)</span> is its sourced lattice reduct, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OneVal}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\">\\(\\operatorname{OneVal}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\)</span> is its sourced top value.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf B^-)\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf B^-)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf B)\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf B)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta_{\\mathbf B}(F)\">\\(\\Theta_{\\mathbf B}(F)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{\\mathbf B}(\\theta)\">\\(\\Phi_{\\mathbf B}(\\theta)\\)</span> are defined below.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}filter\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\n\\Theta_{\\mathbf B}(F)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in|\\mathbf B|^2:\\exists f\\in F\\;\n(a\\wedge^{\\mathbf B}f=b\\wedge^{\\mathbf B}f)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}filter\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\n\\Theta_{\\mathbf B}(F)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in|\\mathbf B|^2:\\exists f\\in F\\;\n(a\\wedge^{\\mathbf B}f=b\\wedge^{\\mathbf B}f)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}filter\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\n\\Phi_{\\mathbf B}(\\theta)\\coloneqq\n\\{a\\in|\\mathbf B|:\\langle a,\\operatorname{OneVal}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\rangle\\in\\theta\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}filter\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\n\\Phi_{\\mathbf B}(\\theta)\\coloneqq\n\\{a\\in|\\mathbf B|:\\langle a,\\operatorname{OneVal}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\rangle\\in\\theta\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}filter\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\land F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf B^-)\n\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf B)\n\\to\\Bigl(\\Phi_{\\mathbf B}(\\theta)\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf B^-)\n\\land\\Theta_{\\mathbf B}(F)\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf B)\n\\land\\Phi_{\\mathbf B}(\\Theta_{\\mathbf B}(F))=F\n\\land\\Theta_{\\mathbf B}(\\Phi_{\\mathbf B}(\\theta))=\\theta\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}filter\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\land F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf B^-)\n\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf B)\n\\to\\Bigl(\\Phi_{\\mathbf B}(\\theta)\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf B^-)\n\\land\\Theta_{\\mathbf B}(F)\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf B)\n\\land\\Phi_{\\mathbf B}(\\Theta_{\\mathbf B}(F))=F\n\\land\\Theta_{\\mathbf B}(\\Phi_{\\mathbf B}(\\theta))=\\theta\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>In Boolean algebras, filters correspond bijectively to congruences, with ultrafilters corresponding to maximal congruences.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"prop-filter-congruence-—-Filter-Congruence","text":"prop-filter-congruence — Filter-Congruence","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-boolalg","status":"resolved","id":"757a95a2c335d9fb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-boolalg]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"9beeac4373d773f8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-filter]]","embed":false},{